  "description": "I possessed someone in a depraved adult BL novel and met the young obsessive male lead (Top). After being bullied by the bottom for years, he turns to a darker path in his adulthood and becomes the crown prince, indulging in imprisonment, obsession and all sorts of heinous adult past-times. Hmm… Then if the bottom never bullied the top, it would have a happy ending, right? \n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)\n\n*Note: This is the promotional one-shot for the homonym novel.*",
